# Legacy leftovers from before the SQLite migration (§14.1) and the later
# Postgres migration (§14.26) -- real user/climb data (bcrypt hashes, live
# session tokens included) from when these flat JSON files were still the
# runtime datastore. Nothing reads them any more (the one-time
# scripts/migrate-json-to-sqlite.js importer that once consumed them is
# gone too), but they may still physically sit in an old working copy, so
# they stay ignored rather than risk one getting swept into a future
# `git add -A`.
server/users.json
server/climbs.json
server/orphaned-ascents.json
